{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch7KuvyKAhoX8Uqr9X1p7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Before I draft, a few questions. Your answers will change what the update says:\n\n1. **What's behind \"profitable next year\"?** At $95k a month you spend about $1.14M a year, and the last six months brought in $212k, with most of it in March and April. Investors will check this claim first. What does the plan assume: number of beekeepers and hives, cost cuts, a price change, or new channels? If you can't back it with numbers, I'd suggest a weaker but defensible claim, such as \"the $600k gets us to X.\"\n2. **What are the bridge terms, and how long does $600k last?** Is it a SAFE or a convertible note? What are the cap, the discount and the minimum check, and is there a close date? $340k plus $600k at your current spend lasts roughly 10 months. Does that get you through next spring's sales season, and what milestone are you raising toward?\n3. **How do you answer the $45 competitor?** Your sensor is $55, and theirs costs $7 more than yours costs you to make. Do you have better accuracy, a longer track record, the app, lock-in, or data from customers they don't have? Have any of your customers looked at their product, and did any switch or stay?\n4. **What do the 31 customers look like?** How many hives are you in, and how much of the $4/month app revenue keeps coming in? Did any of last year's 12 leave? How much of the revenue is your biggest customer?\n5. **Can the 18% vs 31% winter-loss story be stated fairly?** He also changed his mite treatment. Will he let you name him or quote him? Do any other customers have before-and-after numbers?\n6. **Who signs it, who gets it, and is there anything investors will learn anyway?** For example a missed target from your last update, a key hire leaving, or a cost that's going up."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":708,"cache_read_input_tokens":9576,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":708},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"55da5f8c-65bb-45e7-b0d8-a3a12959d5fc","uuid":"72a1e543-c54f-4d2d-874c-ab850f8ef410","timestamp":"2026-11-16T21:36:03.981Z","request_id":"req_011Ch7Kuvq8UqQ458NaJaXkw"}
